    "romaji": "Majutsu wo Kiwamete Tabi ni Deta Tensei Elf, Moteamashita Jumyou de Ikeru Densetsu to Naru",
    "english": null,
    "native": "魔術を極めて旅に出た転生エルフ、持て余した寿命で生ける伝説となる"
  },
  "synonyms": [
    "The Reincarnated Elf Left on a Journey to Master His Magic and With His Extra Lifespan Became a Living Legend",
    "Tensei Elf ni Yoru 900-Nen no Yuukku Slow Life"
  ],
  "coverImage": {
